# ⚠️ THE CSP IS PART OF THE PRODUCT, NOT BOILERPLATE. It was written before the
# site had a map or a checkout, and it silently broke both: `script-src 'self'`
# blocked Mapbox GL AND Paddle.js, so the globe fell back to a flat painted
# circle and the pricing page showed no prices with dead buy buttons. A blocked
# script fails with no visible error on the page, so nothing surfaces it except
# the console.
#
# Anything added to this site that talks to a third party needs its domains
# added here IN THE SAME CHANGE. What each entry is for:
#   script-src   api.mapbox.com (GL JS), *.paddle.com (Paddle.js; sandbox
#                serves from sandbox-cdn.paddle.com, hence the wildcard)
#   worker-src   blob: - Mapbox GL runs its tile workers from blob URLs and
#                renders NOTHING without this. Not covered by script-src.
#   frame-src    *.paddle.com - the checkout overlay is an iframe. Without it
#                the button appears to do nothing at all.
#   connect-src  mapbox tiles + telemetry, paddle, supabase
#   style-src    api.mapbox.com serves mapbox-gl.css

# Cloudflare Pages headers — security + caching
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' https://cdn.fontshare.com https://api.fontshare.com https://*.paddle.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://api.fontshare.com https://api.mapbox.com; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://api.mapbox.com https://*.paddle.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; child-src 'self' blob: https://*.paddle.com; frame-src https://*.paddle.com; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co https://api.mapbox.com https://events.mapbox.com https://*.paddle.com; object-src 'none'

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/llms.txt
  Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

# Universal links: Apple requires JSON content-type, no redirect, on this exact path
/.well-known/apple-app-site-association
  Content-Type: application/json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
